# Architecture

- Frontend: React 19 + Vite + TypeScript + Tailwind v4
- Backend: Python API (not implemented in Phase 0)
- Integrations: Jira Cloud + Azure DevOps Services, read-only, server-side credentials
- AI: OpenAI for transcription assist, adaptive questioning, draft scoring
- Persistence: SQLite on mounted volume via `DATABASE_PATH`
- Scale: single replica while SQLite is used
- Follow `docs/target-architecture.md` and ADRs under `docs/decisions/`
- Prefer vertical slices that replace one mocked screen at a time
